<doc id="65571" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=65571" title="Diana Spencer">
Diana Spencer

Diana Frances &lt;a href="Mountbatten-Windsor"&gt;Mountbatten-Windsor&lt;/a&gt;; née Lady Diana Spencer; #ALIH) iku garwa pisanan saka &lt;a href="Charles%20III%20saka%20Karajan%20Manunggal"&gt;Charles III&lt;/a&gt;, anak pambarep Ratu &lt;a href="Elizabeth%20II"&gt;Elizabeth II&lt;/a&gt; lan uga mianangka pewaris takhta karajan &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt; lan 15 nagara &lt;a href="Persemakmuran"&gt;Persemakmuran&lt;/a&gt; Inggris. Putra-putrné, &lt;a href="Pangeran%20William%20saka%20Wales"&gt;Pangeran William&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pangeran%20Henry%20saka%20Wales"&gt;Harry&lt;/a&gt; ana ing urutan kaloro lan katelu sajeroning urutan pewarisan takhta mau.
<h2>Babad salira</h2>
Babad salira.
Diana Frances Spencer iku putra kaloro saka &lt;a href="Edward%20John%20Spencer"&gt;Edward John Spencer&lt;/a&gt;, sing sabanjuré dadi Earl Spencer angka 8, karo garwa pisanan &lt;a href="Frances%20Shand%20Kydd"&gt;Frances Spencer, Viscountess Althorp&lt;/a&gt;. Diana dilairaké ing Park House, &lt;a href="Sandringham%2C%20Norfolk"&gt;Sandringham&lt;/a&gt;, ing &lt;a href="Norfolk"&gt;Norfolk&lt;/a&gt;, Inggris, lan dibaptis ing Gréja Santa Maria Magdalena déning Pendeta &lt;a href="Percy%20Herbert"&gt;Percy Herbert&lt;/a&gt;.
Diana duwé latar wuri kulawarga karajan lan bangsawan. Saka ibuné, Diana marisi getih wong Amérika. Leluhur Diana sawijining wanita saka kulawarga sugih saka Amérika, &lt;a href="Frances%20Works"&gt;Frances Works&lt;/a&gt;. Saka ramané, Diana minangka katurunan langsung &lt;a href="Raja%20Charles%20II"&gt;Raja Charles II&lt;/a&gt; lumantar loro putra tanpa nikah lan nerusaké &lt;a href="Raja%20James%20II"&gt;Raja James II&lt;/a&gt; liwat siji putri sing tanpa nikah. Miturut panyusun biografi Diana, &lt;a href="Lady%20Colin%20Campbell"&gt;Lady Colin Campbell&lt;/a&gt;, leluhur Diana, &lt;a href="Eliza%20Kewark"&gt;Eliza Kewark&lt;/a&gt; (sawatara sumber ngéja jeneng Kewark minangka "Kevork" utawa "Kevorkian") asal saka &lt;a href="Bombay"&gt;Bombay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; lan kamungkinan katurunan wong India, sanadyan kulawarga Diana kerep nyatakaké yèn kulawarga "Kevork/Kewark" iku saka &lt;a href="Armenia"&gt;Armenia&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé wong tuwané pisahan, Diana banjur dirumat déning ramané.
<h2>Séda</h2>
Séda.
Tanggal &lt;a href="31%20Agustus"&gt;31 Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt; Diana tilar donya sajeroning kacilakan montor ing dalan trowong Pont de l'Alma ing kutha &lt;a href="Paris"&gt;Paris&lt;/a&gt; bebarengan karo &lt;a href="Dodi%20Al-Fayed"&gt;Dodi Al-Fayed&lt;/a&gt; lan supir &lt;a href="Henri%20Paul"&gt;Henri Paul&lt;/a&gt;.
