<doc id="66527" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=66527" title="Ismail">
Ismail

Ismail (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Basa Arab&lt;/a&gt; إسماعيل) (watara &lt;a href="1911"&gt;1911&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1779"&gt;1779&lt;/a&gt; SM) iku &lt;a href="nabi"&gt;nabi&lt;/a&gt; sajeroning kaprecayan &lt;a href="Islam"&gt;agama Islam&lt;/a&gt;. Ismail iku putra saka &lt;a href="Ibrahim"&gt;Ibrahim&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Siti%20Hajar"&gt;Hajar&lt;/a&gt;, kakang kandhung saka &lt;a href="Ishaq"&gt;Ishaq&lt;/a&gt;. Ismail dadi nabi ing taun &lt;a href="1850"&gt;1850&lt;/a&gt; SM. Ismail manggon ing &lt;a href="Amaliq"&gt;Amaliq&lt;/a&gt; lan ngayahi dhakwah kanggo Qabilah &lt;a href="Yaman"&gt;Yaman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mekah"&gt;Mekah&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambaké karan kaping 12 sajeroning &lt;a href="Al-Quran"&gt;Al-Quran&lt;/a&gt;. Ismail séda ing taun 1779 SM ing Mekah. 
Nabi Ismail as iku wong sing sabar, apikan, lan alus atine. Dhèwèké tansah netepi janjine, kaya kang dingendikakake dening &lt;a href="Allah"&gt;Allah Swt&lt;/a&gt;:
"Lan critakna (&lt;a href="Mukamad"&gt;Muhammad&lt;/a&gt;) crita Ismail ana ing Kitab (&lt;a href="Kuran"&gt;Al-Qur'an&lt;/a&gt;). Satemene dhèwèké iku temen marang janjine, Rasul lan Nabi" (QS &lt;a href="Surat%20Maryam"&gt;Maryam&lt;/a&gt;:54).
