<doc id="66602" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=66602" title="Józef Gosławski">
Józef Gosławski

Józef Jan Gosławski (lair 24 April 1908 ing &lt;a href="Polan%C3%B3wka%2C%20Opole%20Lubelskie%20County"&gt;Polanówka&lt;/a&gt; cedhak &lt;a href="Lublin"&gt;Lublin&lt;/a&gt;, tilar donya 23 Januari 1963 ing &lt;a href="Warsawa"&gt;Warsawa&lt;/a&gt;) – &lt;a href="Polen"&gt;Polen&lt;/a&gt; seniman pematung lan seniman ukir medhali. Pangripta koin (antarané. 5 zł kanthi gambar warigaluh), monumèn (conto. &lt;a href="Fr%C3%A9d%C3%A9ric%20Chopin%20monument%20ing%20%C5%BBelazowa%20Wola"&gt;Frederic Chopin ing Żelazowa Wola&lt;/a&gt;) lan medhali (conto. Taun 1939). Pamenang akèh kompetisi artistik; lan nampa bintang &lt;a href="Silver%20Cross%20of%20Merit"&gt;Silver Cross of Merit&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Biografi</h2>
Biografi.
Mangsa cilikan Józef Gosławski manggon ing &lt;a href="W%C4%85wolnica%2C%20Lublin%20Voivodeship"&gt;Wąwolnica&lt;/a&gt; karo wong tuwané, loro sadulur lanang (kalebu sadulur lanang anom &lt;a href="Stanis%C5%82aw%20Gos%C5%82awski"&gt;Stanisław Gosławski&lt;/a&gt;, sing uga dadi pamatung) lan loro sadulur wadon. Józef miwiti pendhidhikan artistik ing Building Crafts School sing diadegaké déning &lt;a href="Jan%20Koszczyc-Witkiewicz"&gt;Jan Koszczyc-Witkiewicz&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Kazimierz%20Dolny"&gt;Kazimierz Dolny&lt;/a&gt;. Sawisé rampung sekolah iki Józef lulus ujian lumebu &lt;a href="Jan%20Matejko%20Academy%20of%20Fine%20Arts"&gt;Academy of Fine Arts in Kraków&lt;/a&gt;, nanging panjenengané isih kliwat anom kanggo miwiti studi. Józef nerusaké sekolah ing National Decorative Arts and Artistic Industry School ing &lt;a href="Krak%C3%B3w"&gt;Kraków&lt;/a&gt;. Józef kapangaruhan déning karya-karya &lt;a href="Stanis%C5%82aw%20Szukalski"&gt;Stanisław Szukalski&lt;/a&gt;, nanging dudu anggota saka Horned Heart Tribe.
