<doc id="66881" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=66881" title="Queensland">
Queensland

Queensland iku &lt;a href="Nagara-praja%20Australia"&gt;praja&lt;/a&gt; gedhé dhéwé kaloro ing &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; sawisé &lt;a href="Australia%20Kulon"&gt;Australia Kulon&lt;/a&gt;, lan manggon laladan lor-wétan ing bawana iki. Praja iki wewatesan karo &lt;a href="Northern%20Territory"&gt;Northern Territory&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih kulon, &lt;a href="Australia%20Kidul"&gt;Australia Kidul&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih kidul-kulon lan &lt;a href="New%20South%20Wales"&gt;New South Wales&lt;/a&gt; ing sisih kidul. Ing sisih wétan, Queensland wewatesan karo &lt;a href="Sagara%20Koral"&gt;Sagara Koral&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Samodra%20Pasifik"&gt;Samodra Pasifik&lt;/a&gt;. Praja iki minangka praja paling padhet sing ndunungi katelu sawisé &lt;a href="New%20South%20Wales"&gt;New South Wales&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Victoria%20%28Australia%29"&gt;Victoria&lt;/a&gt;. Kutha krajané ing &lt;a href="Brisbane"&gt;Brisbane&lt;/a&gt;, praja iki jembar wewengkon dharatané 1.730.648&amp;nbsp;km² kanthi populasi 4.000.000 jiwa (&lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;).
